  <p><font style="margin:0 0 0 0;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:1pt;font-family:Times New Roman;">Revenue to be ~$395 million, +/- 3.0% representing 19% growth over the prior year period and a slight increase sequentially at the mid-point, which is significantly better than typical seasonality GAAP gross margin of 31.5%, +/- 1% Non-GAAP operating expenses 26.5% &#11;of revenue, +/- 1%, which are GAAP operating expenses adjusted for amortization of acquisition-related intangible assets Net interest income of ~$1.0 million Income tax rate to be 18.5%, +/- 3% Shares used to calculate diluted EPS are approximately 46.4 million Amortization of $3.9 million, after tax, for previous acquisitions is not included in these non-GAAP estimates *Guidance as provided on February 10, 2026 Business Outlook - First Quarter 2026</font></p>
